  m_text: '<b><align=center><size=150%>Production</b></align></size>

    Elda Osmani
    - Lead Producer, UI/UX Director

    Jaxson Green - Creative Director, Cutscene
    Animator

    William Dietert - Associate Producer, Casting and Voice Director



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Art</b></align></size>

    Lindsey
    Dyer - Art Lead, Concept Artist, Cutscene Illustrator, Environment Artist

    Drew
    Mulack - Character Concept Artist, Character Animator

    Madalyn Yacoub - UI/UX
    Artist

    Joel Graber - World Artist, 3D Modeler & Animator

    Mary Larsen
    - VFX Artist

    John Forjan - VFX Artist



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Design</b></align></size>

    Char
    O''Shaughnessy - Design Lead, Mechanics Designer, QA

    Caitlin Immer - Combat
    Designer, QA, Level Prototyping

    Gabriel Rodriguez - Spells Systems Designer,
    UI/UX Designer

    Raymond Knapp - Level Designer, Narrative Designer

    Marta
    Tsap - Level Designer

    Ryan Perez - Enemy Designer



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Programming</b></align></size>

    Cade
    Naylor - Programming Lead, Systems Programmer, Tools Programmer

    Brad Dixon
    - Assistant Programming Lead, Systems Programmer

    Clare Grady - Enemy State
    Machine Designer & Programmer, Combat & Systems Programmer

    Tyler Hayes -
    Systems Programmer

    Jay Embry - Mechanics Programmer

    Jakub Gorski -
    VFX & Shader Programming

    Tyler Bouchard - UI/UX Programmer, Systems Programmer

    Aidan
    Ratcliffe - Animation Programmer



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Music & Sound</b></align></size>

    Blayne
    Pummel - Music Composer

    Gabriel Holmes - Sound Designer



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Voice
    Actress</b></align></size>

    Kiaundria Blake Knight - Voice Actor



    <b><align=center><size=150%>Marketing
    & Advertising</b></align></size>

    Lauren Duell'
